msgstr "The score answers how strongly an asset should compete for the next contribution. It is the share of the asset's valuation-adjusted target that is still missing, times its priority: 40% means 40% of the target is missing at full priority. Positive values are buy candidates, zero means skip, and a negative value is a trim signal. Thresholds below are yours to tune and persist with the account."

